              Constant(value='v39'),
              Constant(value='```markdown\n===============================================================================\nSECTION 4.K.2 — REASONING (HARDENED ASCII, v17)\n===============================================================================\n\nDEPTH 0: 🧑\u200d💼 GENERAL ANALYST (Greedy decoding, deterministic CoT spine)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- CoT line cap = 6–7 slides (linear spine).\n- GA assembles baseline from the ordered token hall (🎟 seat badge + 🪪 key card).\n- Mid-spine pause point enables ToT fork after Slide 4.\n\nCoT (Slides 1–4, then pause for ToT)\n  1️⃣ 🏦 Retrieve official site (About)\n  2️⃣ 🏷️ Extract sector phrasing\n  3️⃣ 🕵️ Search for "commercial bank"\n  4️⃣ ⚠️ Check ambiguity/conflict\n  — PAUSE — hand off to ToT (Depth 1)\n\nDEPTH 1: 👩\u200d💻 SPECIALISTS (ToT branches, sampling ON)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- TOT_MAX_DEPTH = 2 (each branch = 2 slides)\n- TOT_BRANCH_FACTOR = 3 (A, B, C)\n- Sampling ON (temperature/top-k/top-p active)\n\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  🌳 ToT-A (GICS/NAICS Specialist)                                    ║\n║    ➀ 🔍 Retrieve code/classification                                 ║\n║    ➁ 🗂 Map to schema (e.g., "Commercial Banking")                    ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║  🌳 ToT-B (FDIC Regulatory Specialist)                               ║\n║    ➀ 🏛 Lookup bank type in FDIC                                     ║\n║    ➁ 🗂 Map to canonical sector/sub-category                          ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║  🌳 ToT-C (LinkedIn Tag Specialist)                                  ║\n║    ➀ 🔗 Extract LinkedIn industry tag                                 ║\n║    ➁ 🗂 Validate mapping to canonical schema                           ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nToT assessment prior to merge (per branch)\n- SchemaCoverage • FactConsistency • RetrievalError • Drift • Canonicality\n- AmbiguityRate • DecisionScore (consensus/vote input)\n\nDEPTH 0 (RESUME): 🧑\u200d💼 GENERAL ANALYST (finish CoT spine)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- GA resumes with merged ToT evidence injected as context.\n\nCoT (Slides 5–7)\n  5️⃣ Validate findings (with ToT input)\n  6️⃣ 🧑\u200d⚖️ Compare/merge all CoT + ToT results using the criteria above\n  7️⃣ 🏁 Finalize canonical mapping\n\nDEPTH 2: 👩\u200d⚖️ SENIOR MANAGER REVIEW (Reflexion)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- REFLEXION_ROUNDS = 2\n  - Round 1: critique → redlines\n  - Round 2: specialists revise → confirm fixes\n\nDEPTH 2: ⚖️ PARTNER POLL (Self-Consistency Vote)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- SC_K = 5, majority_required = true\n- 5 partners independently review distilled variants (3–6 slides each)\n- Consensus ≥ 3/5 PASS; dissent logged as risk note\n\nDEPTH 3: 🏆 CHOSEN PATH (Final Client Deck)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Archetype confirmed • Fixes applied • Risks logged • PASS\n===============================================================================\n```\n')]),
